  "description": "To adjust the intensity of the gangster male lead on the verge of going dark!\n\nAlone and isolated, Baek Yi-Hae finds herself possessed by a depraved 19+ romance game.\n\n *“No way... I didn't get targeted by the gangster male lead, did I?!”*\n\nBaek Yi-Hae unexpectedly moves into the Seo family, a notorious gangster clan. To protect her peaceful, safe life as a supporting character, she must prevent baby gangster Seo Do-Gyeom from going dark and secure a happy ending. Amidst the intersection of school life, romance, and the game's threatening rules, the relationship between Baek Yi-Hae and Seo Do-Gyeom grows increasingly complex...!\n\n*“Why are you only kind to me?”*\n\nA sweet yet deadly survival romance where you can never let your guard down!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
